flowchart LR
    CHANGE[change primary token / switch brand - Ch 40] --> THEME[MaterialTheme re-resolves colorScheme]
    THEME --> READ[components read MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary]
    READ --> WHOLE[WHOLE app re-themes consistently - no per-screen edits]
    MODE[system dark mode toggles] -.-> THEME
    DYNAMIC[wallpaper changes - dynamic color] -.-> THEME
